MagpieTTS-RT links the CUDA 13.2 static runtime components
libcudart_static.a, libcudadevrt.a, and libculibos.a into its distributed
runtime/plugin binaries. These components are listed as redistributable CUDA
Toolkit components in Attachment A of the accompanying EULA.txt.

Source: NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit 13.2 installed EULA
